{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[F]This [C]is the [F]day [C]the [Bb]Lord hath [C]made;
[C7/G]he calls the [F]hours [Bb/D]his [C]own.
[Am]Let [C7]heaven rejoice, [C]let [Bb]earth be [C]glad,
[C7]and praise surround [F/C]the throne.
{end_of_verse}
